  "body": "https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/commit-snapshots/1d4c71382a524b9659e383a1dadbf97d871f52da/#conformance\r\n\r\n> These keywords have equivalent meaning when written in lowercase\r\n\r\nApparently this is not allowed by https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc8174. We should explicitly state that we, and other documents that use Infra, are willfully violating RFC 8174. We should perhaps move the definition of \"willful violation\" from HTML to Infra as well.",
